# Local-only working docs. Public-repo policy (AGENTS.md): never commit
# these; they stay on disk as untracked scratch.
SPEC.md
TASKS.md
NEUTRON_BUGS.md

# Dev-only workspace into the live Neutron checkout; deploy vendoring is
# NEUTRON_BUGS.md N4 / TASKS D2. Not committable: clones without the sibling
# would fail every build.
go.work

# go:embed needs dashboard/dist to exist on a fresh clone; the app serves a
# "dashboard not built" notice from this placeholder until npm run build.
!dashboard/dist/.gitkeep
